  risk: low. Display only, following the \"less text\" policy.","+","+TASK-8: Add strings for the action error text and the checkbox content description (plus the notification text if open question 2 requires it) in `values`, `values-de`, `values-fr`, `values-es` and `values-it`.","+  files: android/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml, android/app/src/main/res/values-{de,fr,es,it}/strings.xml","+  depends: none","+  risk: low. Only the translation quality needs care.","+","+TASK-9: Build (`cd android && ./gradlew assembleDebug`) and record the brief's manual checks (step 6) in implementation.md as done or not done. Include the row-tap → open-route regression on API 24, 31 and 35+.","+  files: docs/jobs/motivation_tap-to-complete-on-the-your-day-widget/implementation.md","+  depends: TASK-1 to TASK-8","+  risk: medium. There is no Android test tooling in CI, so correctness rests on the manual checks.","+","+## Out of scope (from brief)","+","+Uncomplete, an offline retry queue, actions on other rows or widgets."]}],"originalFile":"# Tasks: tap-to-complete on the \"Your Day\" widget\n\nid: motivation\nanalyst:\ndate:\n\n<!-- Produced by @analyst from brief.md. -->\n\n## Task breakdown\n\n<!-- TASK-1: description\n     files: list of files likely affected\n     depends: none\n     risk: low / medium / high — reason\n\nTASK-2: ...\n-->\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01CzNAm8oF2dh6TmbVk7ta8W","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
