edLogo for sharp rendering on HiDPI screens\n0fbc398 chore: release v1.1.1\n9672c30 Changelog 1.1.1: add the date picker and mobile menu fixes\n9b292c0 chore: release v1.1.1\n2ebe0fd Changelog 1.1.1\n42864c4 fix: blend Skyrim bar colours with its overlay, hide WebView gap below page\n25bbb0b sync\n20f5a5a frontend\n5d35f9a chore: add sodevto dev APK build\n96078df feat: match system bar colours to the app theme\n8c629a8 fix: keep WebView above keyboard under edge-to-edge\nfb6bfae package-lock\n0147b10 chore: release v1.1.0\n9558ea0 F-Droid changelog 1.1.0: mention the UI improvements\n05429ea F-Droid changelog 1.1.0: replace the password line with the todo editor\n7fef0bf Add the F-Droid changelog for 1.1.0","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bed1ea8c-a279-4a02-b21e-f558df4812a3","uuid":"8fe9944a-708b-43df-8016-8cd73210d400","timestamp":"2026-10-29T16:58:31.637Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# Implementation: tap-to-complete on the \"Your Day\" widget\n\nid: motivation\ndeveloper:\ndate:\n\n<!-- Produced by @developer after implementation. -->\n\n## Summary\n\n<!-- What was implemented, task by task. Reference task IDs. -->\n\n## Changes\n\n<!-- List of files changed and what changed in each. -->\n\n## Known issues / follow-ups\n\n<!-- Anything that came up during implementation that wasn't in scope but should be tracked. -->\n----\n# Verdict: tap-to-complete on the \"Your Day\" widget\n\nid: motivation\nreviewer:\ndate:\n\n<!-- Produced by @reviewer and/or @security after implementation. -->\n\n## Review\n\n<!-- TASK-1: PASS / FAIL / PARTIAL\n     notes: ...\n\nTASK-2: ...\n-->\n\n## Security\n\n<!-- Any security findings from @security, or \"none\" if not run. -->\n\n## Overall\n\n<!-- APPROVED / REJECTED / NEEDS WORK -->\n<!-- Summary of what needs to change before this can be approved, if anything. -->\n2ed1c35 [motivation] chore: commit all\ne842b1d [motivation] chore: commit all\n12c59dc Scaffold job motivation_tap-to-complete-on-the-y